ategory_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"FzHkziPh867xpgBxH3_IVQ","review_id":"i28DM9afDyzOHc7A7GxpSg","date":"2019-01-22T23:39:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9382838010787964,"text_excerpt":"Vegan and vegetarian options can be hard to find in New Orleans and the fact Seed is 100% I know I can come here and chow. I had been to their original location a few times and enjoyed it and was excited when they opened a second location walking distance from my pad. The service was great... friendly and nice and very informative about the dishes. I will say some of the dishes are heavier than I would expect not necessarily in a bad way but think they could use a little bit a balance with some more fresh vegetable filled dishes. All in all... vegetarian or not... they have food options all will enjoy or at least give it a shot you will be surprised how good it is. :) Oh and yes they do h..."},{"business_id":"FzHkziPh867xpgBxH3_IVQ","review_id":"WjARRgw2LTpb200sglLzvQ","date":"2018-12-29T21:58:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9360678195953369,"text_excerpt":"I am rooting for Seed at this location and not just for selfish reasons like I need a place to go eat when I forget to pack a lunch for work. The food product they put out is pretty consistently good even for meat eaters like me. In fact the menu definitely has a number of mimic dishes or dishes which mimic known meat based dishes. I have tried the eggplant po' boy and I am definitely a fan. I have also had the chickpea salad sandwich which I did enjoy although I wished it was a little more \"wet\". By wet I mean maybe avocado or more dressing in it. I have also noticed that they have a basic standard menu but will offer other creations to take advantage of what is abundant for the season. ..."},{"business_id":"FzHkziPh867xpgBxH3_IVQ","review_id":"v00XtVLYAAkjep_CLKRdWw","date":"2018-10-26T18:00:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9138663411140442,"text_excerpt":"So glad to see another Seed location. When you have food intolerances, it is wonderful to find a place like this where you can order anything on the menu without worry. Highly recommend!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FzHkziPh867xpgBxH3_IVQ","photo_id":"XWjBnR2fzliFgYsPi8TI_w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/XWjBnR2fzliFgYsPi8TI_w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9120286703109741},{"business_id":"FzHkziPh867xpgBxH3_IVQ","photo_id":"Hs55kI8ejpNEqdmZO9RK4A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Hs55kI8ejpNEqdmZO9RK4A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8459630012512207},{"business_id":"FzHkziPh867xpgBxH3_IVQ","photo_id":"iWdQkhARhNXCihSGoogKFg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/iWdQkhARhNXCihSGoogKFg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7379185557365417}]},"notebook_case":null}
